# Horn of the Frostwolf Howler for Exalted Frostwolf Clan (Era rule; the
# reputation comes from Alterac Valley, one of Forever's four battlegrounds).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70532 via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 60,
# 200g, no reputation on the item; MountCapability: Riding 150 and no kind's
# riding, so any race of the side rides it once it has Journeyman Riding);
# items.json / npcs.json for the vendors.
# ASSUMED: the vendor sells it at Exalted (Classic rule; the client item has no
# standing, but its PlayerCondition 3882 "Requires Frostwolf Clan - Exalted" is there for
# a vendor row). In-game check: the vendor's list below Exalted.

step Frostwolf Clan
  tip Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Frostwolf Clan: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins; the Alterac Valley Reputation guide shows the fastest way. Jekyll Flandring waits at the Horde end of Alterac Mountains outside the battleground; Grunnda Wolfheart inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount.
  rep "Frostwolf Clan" Exalted

step Horn of the Frostwolf Howler
  tip The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60. It runs at full speed, so riding it needs Journeyman Riding; any Horde race can ride it.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150
  buy 19029 npc 13219                 -- Jekyll Flandring, 200g
